{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Baseless is a challenging planet-jumping shooter.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Blast from planet to planet with 360\u00b0 gravity, creatively demolishing every enemy in your path. Fire powerful weapons, rescue cute friends, and discover a galaxy worth fighting for. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/extras/ff1bc8bc3ae62ed549fddc1cec3e916b.poster.avif?t=1757596914\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/extras/ff1bc8bc3ae62ed549fddc1cec3e916b.webm?t=1757596914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/extras/ff1bc8bc3ae62ed549fddc1cec3e916b.mp4?t=1757596914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shooting = Movement!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Propel yourself across a planet\u2019s surface, then aim your gun at the ground to blast off. Improvise and master your skills to survive! Combine all your moves to shoot, slash, dash, block, and BLAST the enemies to bits! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/extras/0746fbef6509d4db4ecabd94b35f5153.poster.avif?t=1757596914\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/extras/0746fbef6509d4db4ecabd94b35f5153.webm?t=1757596914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/extras/0746fbef6509d4db4ecabd94b35f5153.mp4?t=1757596914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight through many vibrant zones</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Encounter tons of unique enemies and hazards as well as powerful weapons. Unlock the secrets of this dangerous galaxy. Can you slay all the menacing zone bosses? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/extras/1eb04eda029fe23290a0469d5c329034.poster.avif?t=1757596914\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/extras/1eb04eda029fe23290a0469d5c329034.webm?t=1757596914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/extras/1eb04eda029fe23290a0469d5c329034.mp4?t=1757596914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gain new powers to add to your arsenal of destruction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Use your bubble shield to deflect incoming projectiles before dashing into the action! Stun an enemy with your sword and then blow them to bits with an explosive barrel! Chain together your grappling hook and shotgun to bring the pain! A deep moveset allows for satisfying mechanical mastery. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1129260?t=1757596914","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757596914","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/4d0be8735278a983c925c7cd01d1f6977870dfa9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757596914","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1129260/4d0be8735278a983c925c7cd01d1f6977870dfa9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757596914","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":2